This repository restores all 615 files from the supplied original release
package, SpinDoctor-3.1.2.zip, without modifying their bytes. The original
SHA256SUMS.txt and sealed integrity manifests apply to those package files.
Repository-level documentation, verification helper and the separately supplied
command-language guide are additions outside the original package manifest.

The previously published 298-qubit update is preserved in Git history and on
the preservation branch identified in RESTORATION.md. The restored attachment
is the original 29-qubit version, not that later update.

The UltraWide Appliance preview material under source/mvp/ultrawide-appliance/
retains its supplied Product Preview Tester License and third-party notices.
See source/mvp/ultrawide-appliance/repository/UltraWide-Appliance-main/LICENSE,
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and docs/licenses/SUPPLIED-PREVIEW-NOTICE.md there.
The files under source/mvp/tenq/ retain their accompanying ULTRAWIDE_LICENSE.txt,
ULTRAWIDE_PROVENANCE.md and ULTRAWIDE_THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

SpinDoctor is a classical simulator running on a conventional CPU, with OpenCL
GPU sampling for verification. It is not a quantum computer.
